<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">Meitei: Roman Script 1st Translation</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">2 Timothy</para>
  <para style="toc1">TIMOTHY-DA I-ba Paul-gi Anisuba Chithi</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timothy</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tim</para>
  <para style="mt1">TIMOTHY-DA</para>
  <para style="mt2">I-ba Paul-gi Anisuba Chithi</para>
  <para style="imt1">Wahoudok</para>
  <para style="ip">2 Timothy asi Paul-na mahakki tung-inba Timothy-da i-ba anisuba chithini. 2 Timothy asi Paul-gi punsi loiramdaida ibani. Matam asida mahak Rome-da phadok taduna leibani (2 Timothy 1:16). Paul-ga Timothy-ga naknaba mari leirammi, mahakna Timothy-bu ichanupa haina kayarak palli (Philippians 2:22; 1 Timothy 1:2, 1:18).</para>
  <para style="ip">Chithi asi Paul-na singlupta nattaduna misak amada i-ba chithi marigi manungda amani. Atoppa chithi ahumdudi 1 Timothy, Titus amasung Philemon-ni. 2 Timothy i-ba matam aduda Rome-gi ningthourenna panba lamsingda Christian-singbu ot-neirammi. Paul-na keisumsangda leiba amadi mahakna Timothy-da awa ana khaangnaba paotak piba adu masigi maramna oiba yai. 1 Timothy-da i-khibagumna lanna tambibasinggi maramda cheksin wasing piri (1 Timothy 1:16-18). Khudong thiba matamsing thengnarakkani hainasu mahakna Timothy-da hairi (3:1).</para>
  <para style="iot">Yaopham Takpa</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Chithi asi Paul-na Timothy-bu khurumlaga hou-i <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TI 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref>)</char> aduga mahakpu pukning thougatli <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TI 1:3-18">1:3-18</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Timothy-bu khaangba kannaba kanna thougatpi <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TI 2:1-13">2:1-13</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Mathangda mayamgi oiba paotak khara mahakna Timothy-da piri <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TI 2:14-26">2:14-26</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">4. Tungda thorakkadaba thoudoksinggi maramda amadi madusing adu karamna achumba mawongda thengnagadage haibadu mahakna Timothy-da hairi <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TI 3:1-4:8">3:1–4:8</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">5. Paul-na masagi oiba wa khara Timothy-da hairaga chithi asi loisilli <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TI 4:9-22">4:9-22</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1"/>Tengban Mapugi aningbagi matung inna Christta Jisugi pakhonchatpa oiriba amadi eikhoina Christtaga tinnajabadagi phangjaba wasakpikhraba hingba adubu phongdoknaba thabiraba Paul eihakna,<verse eid="2TI 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:1">Pakhon 16:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>eihakki nungsijaraba ichanupa Timothy-da:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 1:2">Ipa Ibungo Tengban Mapu amadi eikhoigi Mapu Ibungo Christta Jisuna nahakpu thoujal, chanbiba amasung ingthaba pibiba oirasanu.<verse eid="2TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Thagatpa amasung thougatpiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3"/>Eigi ipa ipusingna tourambagumna, asengba achum aran khangba pukningga loinana eina thougal toujariba Tengban Mapubu thagatchei. Eina ahing nungthil animakta haijabada nahakpu ningsingduna Ibungo mahakpu thagatchei. <verse eid="2TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4"/>Nahakki takhiba pi adu eina ningsing-i, eihak haraobana thannaba eina nahakpu unaba yamna pamjei. <verse eid="2TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:1">Pakhon 16:1</ref></char></note>Nabok Lois amasung nahakki ima Eunice-tasu leiramba thajaba adugumna nahakki taseng tasengna thajaba adu eina ningsing-i. Madu nangondasu lei haiba eina tasengna thajei. <verse eid="2TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6"/>Maram asigidamak eina nangonda khut thambikhiba matamda Tengban Mapuna nangonda pibikhiba khudol adu meigumna chakkhat-handuna thamnaba eina nangonda ningsingli. <verse eid="2TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7"/>Maramdi Tengban Mapuna eikhoida akibagi thawai pibide; adubu panggalgi, nungsibagi amasung masa khudum chanbagi thawai pibi.<verse eid="2TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8"/>Maram aduna eikhoigi Mapu Ibungogi maramgidamak sakhi pibada ikaiganu; aduga Christtagi maramgidamak phadok oiriba eigidamaksu ikaibiganu. Adubu Tengban Mapugi panggalgi mapanna aphaba paogidamak awabada eiga loinana saruk yaminnasi. <verse eid="2TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9"/>Ibungona eikhoibu kanbire amasung Ibungo mahakmakki mi oinaba eikhoibu koubire, masi eikhoina toukhiba karigumba thabak amagidamak natte adubu Ibungo mahakki ningba amasung thoujalgi matung innani. Thoujal asi taibang leisemdringei mamangda Christta Jisugi mapanna eikhoida pibire, <verse eid="2TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10"/>adubu houjikti, eikhoigi Kanbiba Mapu Christta Jisuna lengbirakpagi mapanna madu eikhoida utpire. Ibungona asibagi panggalbu manghalle aduga aphaba pao asigi mapanna hingba amasung sinaidaba punsi adu mangalda pubire.<verse eid="2TI 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TI 2:7">1 Tim 2:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Atoppa phurupsingda aphaba pao asi sandoknaba Tengban Mapuna eibu pakhonchatpa amasung tambiba oja ama oina khandokpibani <verse eid="2TI 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12"/>Maram asigidamak eihakna awabasing asi khaanglibani. Adubu masina eibu ikaihande maramdi eina thajariba mahak adu eina khang-i, aduga eina mangonda sinakhiba adu numit adu phaoba ngakpi senbiduna thamba ngammi haiba eina tasengna khang-i. <verse eid="2TI 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13"/>Eina nangonda takpi tambikhiba achumba waheising adu nahakna in-gadaba pandam oina chetna paiyu, aduga Christta Jisuda leiba thajaba amasung nungsiba aduda lengdana leiyu. <verse eid="2TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14"/>Nangonda sinakhiba aphabasing adu, eikhoigi nungda leiriba Thawai Asengbagi panggalgi mapanna ngaksellu.<verse eid="2TI 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15"/>Phygelus amasung Hermogenes yaona Asia-da leiba pumnamakna eibu thadoklamle haiba nahak khangliba aduni. <verse eid="2TI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16"/>Onesiphorus-ki imung manungda Mapu Ibungona chanbiba oirasanu, maramdi mahakna eibu yamna toina pukning thougatpi. Eina keisumsangda leiba asi mahakna ikaikhide, <verse eid="2TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17"/>adubu mahakna Rome-da hek thungbaga eibu phangdriphaoba mahakna eibu thibani. <verse eid="2TI 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18"/>Numit aduda Mapu Ibungona Ibungo mahakki chanbiba mangonda pibiba oirasanu! Ephesus-ta mahakna eibu kayagi matik pangbikhiba adu nahakna sengna khangliba aduni.<verse eid="2TI 1:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Christtagi thajaba yaba lanmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1"/>Eigi ichanupa, eikhoina Christta Jisugi thoujal aduda panggal kanba oiyu. <verse eid="2TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2"/>Sakhi kayagi mamangda nahakna takhiba eina takpi tambikhibasing adu mi ateidasu tambiba ngamgadaba thajaba yaba misingda sinnabiyu.<verse eid="2TI 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3"/>Christta Jisugi thajaba yaba lanmi amagumna eihakka loinana awaba khaangminnasi. <verse eid="2TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4"/>Lanmigi thabak touriba lanmi amana mahakki lamjingliba phamnaiba adubu pelhanba pammi maram aduna mahakna micham amagi thabaksingda yetsinnahande. <verse eid="2TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5"/>Kanagumba sanaroi amana lamjen tanaba yaorabadi chatkadaba kanglon adugi matung inna chendrabadi mahakna mana phangba ngamloi. <verse eid="2TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6"/>Thabak kanna suba loumi aduna mahei marong adudagi mahakna saruk hanna phangba tabani. <verse eid="2TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7"/>Eina hairiba asida munna wakhal tou, maramdi Mapu Ibungona nangonda masi pumnamak asigi wakhal taba adu pibigani.<verse eid="2TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8"/>Eina sandokpa Aphaba Paoda tambibagumna, David-ki charol surol oiriba aduga asibadagi hinggatpikhraba Jisu Christtabu ningsing-u. <verse eid="2TI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9"/>Aphaba Pao adu sandokpagi maramna eihak awaba khaanglibani amadi maral leiraba mi amagumna yotling phalang thanglibani. Adubu Tengban Mapugi waheidi yotling phalangna punde. <verse eid="2TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10"/>Maram aduna lomba naidaba matik mangalga loinana Christta Jisuda leiba aran-khubham adu Tengban Mapuna khandoklaba makhoinasu phangnanaba eina makhoigidamak pumnamak khaang-i. <verse eid="2TI 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11"/>Masi achumba waphamni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">“Eikhoina Ibungoga siminnarabadi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">eikhoi Ibungoga hingsu hingminnagani.<verse eid="2TI 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:33">Mat 10:33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:9">Luk 12:9</ref></char>
    </note>Eikhoina awaba kaanglabadi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">eikhoi Ibungoga loinana pansu panminnagani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">Eikhoina Ibungo mahakpu yadrabadi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">mahaknasu eikhoibu yabiroi.<verse eid="2TI 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13"/>Eikhoina thajaba yadaba oirabasu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">mahakti thajaba yaba oina adumak leigani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">maramdi mahak masana masamakta chumdaba oiba ngamde.”<verse eid="2TI 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tengban Mapuna yabiraba thabak suba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14"/>Waphamsing asi makhoida ningsinghallu. Waheisinggi maramda yetnadanaba Tengban Mapugi mangda makhoida cheksin wa haiyu; maduda kanaba karisu leite, maduna atabasingda manghanbata oihalli. <verse eid="2TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15"/>Tengban Mapugi achumba wa adu chumna tambiba, ikaipham thoktaba thabak suba mi, Tengban Mapugi mityengda mapung phana apenba mi ama haiba adu oinaba ngamba makhei hotnou. <verse eid="2TI 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16"/>Tengban Mapuna yaroidaba apangba warising adudagi leithok-u, maramdi maduna misingbu Tengban Mapugi maphamdagi henna henna lapthok-halli. <verse eid="2TI 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17"/>Adugumba tambiba adudi hakchangbu chasillakpa apatpa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gangrene </char></note> amagumbani. Makhoigi marakta Hymenaeus amasung Philetus-su amani. <verse eid="2TI 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18"/>Hinggatpa adu hannana thokkhre haiduna makhoi achumba lambi adu thadokkhre aduga thajaraba mi kharagi thajaba adu manghalle. <verse eid="2TI 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:5">Masing 16:5</ref></char></note>Adum oinamak Tengban Mapuna semkhraba achetpa yumpham adudi lenghanba ngamloi; maduda waheising asi iduna lei: “Mapu Ibungona mahakki misingbu khang-i” amasung “Mapu Ibungogi misingni haijabasingna aranba toubadagi leithorakkadabani.”<verse eid="2TI 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20"/>Achouba yum amagi manungda makhal khudingmakki pukham tenggotsing lei: kharana sana amadi lupana sabani aduga khara amana u amadi leipakna sabani; khara amana akhannaba thabakta aduga kharana icham chamba thabakta sijinnabani. <verse eid="2TI 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21"/>Phattaba pumnamaksing adudagi sengdokcharaba makhoina aruba thabakkidamak sijinnagani maramdi Mapu Ibungona aphaba thabak khudingmakki sijinnaba yaraba katthoklaba amadi kanaraba haibadu oire. <verse eid="2TI 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22"/>Naha oibagi apambasing adudagi chenthok-u aduga asengba pukningdagi Mapu Ibungobu koujabasingga loinana achumba chatpa, thajaba, nungsiba amasung ingthababu tallu. <verse eid="2TI 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23"/>Apangba amasung kannadaba marei yetnaba adudagi leithok-u maramdi maduna khatna-cheinaba thok-halli haiba nahakna khang-i. <verse eid="2TI 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24"/>Mapu Ibungogi manaidi khatna-cheinaba touroidabani, adubu pumnamakki maphamda thoujal heiba, takpi tambiba ngamba amasung khaangheiba oigadabani. <verse eid="2TI 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25"/>Nahakki maiyokta leibasingbu Tengban Mapuna makhoida pukning hongba pibiduna achumbada chingbirakkani haibagi thajabaga loinana makhoida pukning tapna takpigadabani. <verse eid="2TI 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26"/>Adu oirabadi makhoina wakhal tarakkani aduga Devil-na makhoibu phaduna mahakki aningba touhalliba lang adudagi nanthokkani.<verse eid="2TI 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Aroiba numitsing</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1"/>Aroiba numitsingda khudong thiba matamsing lakkani haibasi khang-u. <verse eid="2TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2"/>Misingna masagi oijabata thiba, sel pamganba, chaothokpa, napal touba, thina ngangba, mama mapana haiba indaba, toubimal khangdaba amasung sengdaba, <verse eid="2TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3"/>nungsiba leitaba, ngakpiheitaba, migi mangnaba wa ngangba, masa khudum chandaba, tamthiba oiba, aphababu tukkachaba, <verse eid="2TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4"/>lounam touba, cheksindaba, nawangba oiba, Tengban Mapubu nungsibagi mahutta makhoina masabu nungaihanbana henna pamba oigani; <verse eid="2TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5"/>Tengban Mapu ningbagi mawongdi louraga madugi panggal adubudi yaroi. Adugumba mising adudagi lapna leiyu. <verse eid="2TI 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6"/>Makhoigi maraktagi kharana misinggi yumda changduna, apamba makhal khudingna chinglibi, papki maralna potlum puriba asonba nupisingbu makhoina khudum challi, <verse eid="2TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7"/>matam pumnamakta nupising asina tamnaba hotnei adubu achumba adudi keidounungda makhoina khangba ngamde. <verse eid="2TI 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:11">Khong 7:11</ref></char></note>Jannes amadi Jambres-na Moses-ki maiyokta lepkhibagumna masigi mising asinasu achumbagi maiyokta leppi. Makhoising asi wakhal maang-i aduga thajabagi maramda kanadaba oire. <verse eid="2TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9"/>Adubu makhoi karisu henna chaokhatloi, maramdi mi pumnamakna makhoigi apangba adu ugani. Madumak Jannes amasung Jambres-dasu thokkhi.<verse eid="2TI 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aroiba paotak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10"/>Adubu nahakti eigi tambiba, lamchat sajat amadi eigi ningba adu ille aduga eigi thajaba, kuina khangba, nungsiba, khaangheiba, <verse eid="2TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:14-52">Pakhon 13:14-52</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:1-7">Pakhon 14:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:8-20">Pakhon 14:8-20</ref></char></note>eibu ot-neiba amadi eigi awaba khaangbanachingba adu nahakna khang-i. Antioch, Iconium amasung Lystra-da eingonda thokkhiba ot-neibasing adu eina khaangkhiba pumnamak adu nahakna khanglibaduni. Adubu Mapu Ibungona pumnamak adudagi eibu kanbikhi. <verse eid="2TI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12"/>Tasengnamak Christta Jisuda Tengban Mapu ningna hingjaninglabadi ot-neiba phanggani. <verse eid="2TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13"/>Phattaba amasung lounam toubasingna henna henna phatchillakloi, misingbu makhoina minamgani aduga makhoi masamakpusu minamjagani. <verse eid="2TI 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14"/>Adubu nahakti, nangonda tambikhraba amadi chetna thajakhraba achumbasing aduda lengdana leiyu, maramdi nahakna madu kana kanadagi tamjakhibano haiba nahakna khang-i. <verse eid="2TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15"/>Christta Jisu thajabagi mapanna nahakpu aran-khubhamda chingbigadaba lousing pibiba ngamba Asengba Mapugi Puya adu nahakna angang pisak oiringeidagi khanglakkhre haibasi nahak ningsing-u. <verse eid="2TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16"/>Mapugi Puya pumnamak asi Tengban Mapugi sordagi oibani, aduga tambinabagidamak, cheiduna waraknabagidamak, chumthoknabagidamak, amasung achumba chatpagi marida takpinabagidamak kannei. <verse eid="2TI 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17"/>Masina Tengban Mapugi manaibu aphaba thabak khuding touba yananaba mapung phana thourang tounanabani.<verse eid="2TI 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1"/>Tengban Mapugi mangda amasung Ningthou oina panbinaba lengbirakkadaba aduga ahingba amadi asibabu wayenbigadouriba Christta Jisugi mangda eina nangonda yathang asi piri: <verse eid="2TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2"/>wa adu sandok-u, achaba matamdasu, chadaba matamdasu sandoknaba thourang tou; kuina khaangheibaga amadi cheksinna tambibaga loinana chumthokpiyu, cheiduna warakpiyu amasung pukning thougatpiyu. <verse eid="2TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3"/>Achumba tambiba adu misingna taroidaba matam adu lakkani, madugi mahutta makhoi masagi apambasinggi matung in-gani aduga makhoina taningbana langtaknaba adu haigadaba ojasing makhoina henna henna khomjin-gani. <verse eid="2TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4"/>Makhoina achumba tabadagi leithokkhigani aduga semjin sajinba warisingda makhoina wakhal thamgani. <verse eid="2TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5"/>Adubu nahakti phibham pumnamakta pukning laksillu; awaba khaang-u, Aphaba pao sandokpaki thabak adu tou aduga Tengban Mapugi manai ama oibagi thougal adu mapung phana tou.<verse eid="2TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6"/>Eigidamakti thaknaba mahi Tengban Mapuda katpagumna heidokkhre aduga eihak taibangpan asi thadokpagi matam adu nakle. <verse eid="2TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7"/>Eihak lan kanna soknakhre, eina chen-gadaba lamjen adu chenkhre, thajaba adu eina ngakchare. <verse eid="2TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8"/>Houjikti achumba chatpagi luhup adu eigidamak thamjinbire, achumba chatpa Wayel Mapu Ibungona Numit aduda eingonda pibigani aduga eingondata nattana nungsibaga loinana Ibungona lengbirakkadaba adubu khourangna ngaijaribasingdasu pibigani.<verse eid="2TI 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Masagi oiba wa haiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9"/>Eigi inakta thuna laknaba yaribamakhei kanna hotnou, <verse eid="2TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:14">Col 4:14</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Phile 24</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 8:23">2 Cor 8:23</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:3">Gal 2:3</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 1:4">Tit 1:4</ref></char></note>maramdi Demas-na houjikki taibangpan asibu nungsibadagi eibu thadoklamlaga Thessalonica-da chatkhre. Crescens-su Galatia-da, aduga Titus-na Dalmatia-da chatkhre. <verse eid="2TI 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:14">Col 4:14</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Phile 24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 12:12">Pakhon 12:12</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">Col 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Phile 24</ref></char></note>Luke khaktadi eiga loinari. Eina thougal toubagi thabak asida mateng pangbinaba nahakna lakpada Mark-pu pubirak-u. <verse eid="2TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Pakhon 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:21">Eph 6:21</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 6:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:7">Col 4:7</ref>,<ref loc="COL 4:8">8</ref></char></note>Tychicus-pu eina Ephesus-ta thakhibani. <verse eid="2TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:6">Pakhon 20:6</ref></char></note>Nahakna lakpada Troas-ta leiba Carpus-ta thanamba eigi achonba phi adu pubirak-u; aduga lairiksing adusu pubirak-u maru oina sa-unda i-ba lairiksing adu pubirak-u.<verse eid="2TI 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TI 1:20">1 Tim 1:20</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 62:12">Isei 62:12</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:6">Rom 2:6</ref></char>
    </note>Yotsuba Alexander-na eingonda yamna phattaba toure. Mahakna toukhiba matung inna Mapu Ibungona mahakki mathakta hanbigani. <verse eid="2TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15"/>Nahaknasu mahakki maramda yamna cheksillu, maramdi mahakna eikhoigi paojelbu thingnanaba kanna hotnei.<verse eid="2TI 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16"/>Eigi ahanba isa ngakthokchaba matamda kana amatana eigi michangda leppikhide, pumnamakna eibu thadoklammi. Madu Tengban Mapuna makhoigi mathakta singthabidaba oisanu! <verse eid="2TI 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17"/>Paojel adu mapung phana eina sandoktuna Jihudi nattaba phurupsingna tanaba Mapu Ibungona eigi inakta leppiduna eingonda panggal pibikhi aduga eibu asibagi khayattagi kanbikhi. <verse eid="2TI 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18"/>Eingonda phattaba landarakpa pumnamaktagi Mapu Ibungona kanbigani aduga Ibungo mahakki swarga Leibakta eibu asoi angam yaodana pubigani. Ibungoda matam pumnamakta matik mangal leiba oirasanu! Amen.<verse eid="2TI 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aroiba warol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:2">Pakhon 18:2</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 1:16">2 Tim 1:16</ref>,<ref loc="2TI 1:17">17</ref></char>
    </note>Priscilla, Aquila amasung Onesiphorus-ki imung manungda eina khurumjari. <verse eid="2TI 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:22">Pakhon 19:22</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 16:23">Rom 16:23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 20:4">Pakhon 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 21:29">21:29</ref></char></note>Erastus-na Corinth-ta leihoure, Trophimus-ti masa ngamdabadagi eina mahakpu Miletus-ta thannamle. <verse eid="2TI 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21"/>Ningthamtha changlaktringeida nahak mapham asida laknaba kanna hotnou.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:21">Eubulus, Pudens, Linus, Claudia amasung atei Christian ichin inao pumnamakna nahakpu khurumjarakli.<verse eid="2TI 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22"/>Mapu Ibungona nahakki thawaiga loinabisanu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:22">Tengban Mapugi thoujal nakhoi pumnamakka loinabisanu.<verse eid="2TI 4:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4"/>
</usx>
